# Context for deploy/Dockerfile, which builds the bridge and the frontend. Keep secrets, build output
# and dependencies out of it.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Recipes and their backups in any directory (bridge/, deploy/ or another deployment directory).
**/mix*.json*
!bridge/mix.example.json
.git
.github
docs
*.log
sonar-project.properties
